:: OC Zach Brochella Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
You walk past the different groups of kids lingering in the halls for one reason or another as you head to the exit to finally end the school day, when something strange catches your ears. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yo, dude! Are you going to Brochella-Lite this weekend?”</span> An older kid asked as he munched on what could only be described as a ‘suspiciously-colored sandwich’. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Bro-… what? What are you talking about.”</span> His friend responded in confusion before adding, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“And you really shouldn’t be eating that. It’s been in my locker for like a week.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Well, they have Brochella, right?”</span> The boy takes another bite. His friend makes the exact same face you make as he munches on the discolored food, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“It’s like this big, sick-ass music festival they have in the city. Well, they sometimes do Brochella-Lite, it’s like the indie version of Brochella dude! All the real artists go to Brochella-Lite, no posers like the normie Brochella. It’s Saturday from like 8 to midnight. Free entry too! Going to be wild. Dude, what is this, ham? Tastes great.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, that does sound pretty cool.”</span> The boy responds, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“And it’s peanut butter. Or it was… I think you need to go to the hospital.”</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Sad",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

You walk away before witnessing a medical emergency brought upon by pure stupidity and hunger. You’re sure he’ll be fine. What’s more, this ‘Brochella-Lite’ sounded pretty interesting. It could be pretty fun to attend, just to look around and listen to some music. Then again, you’re unsure if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> would allow you to be out that late, even on a weekend. <span style="color:Yellow">But it couldn’t hurt to ask.</span> <br>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Zach: Brochella Lite")>>
<<set $ActiveQuests.push("Zach: Brochella Lite")>>
<<set $QuestLog.push(
	{
		Name: "Brochella Lite",
		State: 1,
		ID: "OCZach_M001",
		Category: "Character",
		Type: "Quest",
		Icon: "Music",
		Tags: ["Zach", "Character", "Quest", "Park"],
		Description: "You have heard about a music festival coming up. You want to attend, but will need to get permission from <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Your Father</span> due to its late night time.",
		Objectives: [
			{
				Name: "Ask <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Your Father</span> for Permission to attend Brochella Lite",
				State: 0,
				Total: 1,
			},
		],
	},
)>>
