:: OC Zach Brochella Ask Gabe [nobr]

/* Bedroom */
<<if $GabeBroLocal == "Bedroom">>
    Nervously, you step into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s bedroom. You do it loud enough to make it clear you weren’t trying to sneak in, but not too loud as to annoy him. It is a delicate balance, and you feel your butt clench as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> looks up from what he is doing and glares at you with suspicion. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What do you want?”</span> He says, trying to decide if he’s going to hit you or not. You gulp, saying you wanted to ask him something. <span style="color:Yellow">With a curious expression, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> stands up and walks over to you, staring down at you as he so often does to try and intimidate you.</span> <br>
    <br>

/* Living Room TV */
<<elseif $GabeBroLocal == "TV">>
    Seeing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> lounging on the couch watching TV, you walk into his field of vision and stare at him. You needed him in a good mood, so you wanted to get his attention and let him know you wanted to speak with him without interrupting what he is watching. It is a delicate balance. <span style="color:Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> briefly glances to you out of the corner of his eyes, but waits until a commercial comes on before addressing you. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Alright. What do you want?”</span> He says standing up and walking over to you.</span> <br>
    <br>

/* Hallway */
<<elseif $GabeBroLocal == "Hallway">>
    As you pass <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> in the hallway, you say his name. The boy stops in his tracks, spins around, and glares at you. You can’t tell if he is actually upset or just messing with you. Probably just messing with you, as he wouldn’t normally get upset at just small talk unless he is having a particularly bad day. Still, you can never be too careful around teenagers. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What do you want?”</span> He asks, walking up to you. <span style="color:Yellow">His voice is stern, yet with a hint of friendliness. Seems like it’s been a good day for him.</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>>
<<unset $GabeBroLocal>>

/* Continue */
You ask him if he is planning to go this festival you heard about, Bro-something. You had heard about it randomly and thought it would be cool and know he’s into that and maybe, if he didn’t mind, he could maybe take you? <span style="color:Yellow">Your words stumble out like word vomit as you try to play it off as something you heard in passing, which is technically true, and you don’t feel your heart beating until you get them all out.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> nods slowly in response. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You know, I was thinking about going. Crazy thing though, I asked dad about it, and he said I could go on one condition.”</span> You inhale sharply and hold your breath. Uh-oh. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, for some reason he said I could only go if I take you. I asked why I had to take my annoying little brother to a music festival I wanted to hang out with my friends at, and he just said that I take you or I don’t go.”</span> <br>
<br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Gabe",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

Your heart is beating faster and faster and you felt your lungs turning blue from lack of oxygen. <span style="color:Yellow">This isn’t good. Dad already got to him, meaning he already knows that your going is a requirement for him going.</span> You are already thinking all the ways he’s going to punish you for ruining his weekend plans when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> just sighs and shrugs. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“So, I told him that’s fine. I don’t mind taking you…”</span> You finally breathe out, on the brink of falling unconscious. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“On two conditions.”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Dang it.</span> <br>
<br>

<<if $GabeSocial > 50 or $GabeSociallRank > 0>>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“First, when we get there, we split up. I don’t need my friends knowing I had to babysit you during the festival. You have your fun, and I have mine. We’ll meet up before the last performance and maybe if you prove to me you have good taste, I might get you a souvenir.”</span> You nod, that sounds pretty generous actually. What’s the second condition? <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Simple. Don’t tell Dad I did this.”</span> <br>
<br>
    <<if $PlayerUndies.Type != "None">>
        <span style="color:Pink">Before you can process what he said, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> grips the back of your $PlayerUndies.Name and yanks them into the air, giving you a massive wedgie! He then hooks them onto something, leaving you in quite a painful and embarrassing position. He laughs and ruffles your hair before walking off, leaving you to free yourself. Man, he’s annoying, though you have to admit he got you good.</span> <br>
